## Fan Work Notice

This project is a fan-made programming and terminal art project inspired by
**Naruto** and its visual concepts including the Sharingan, Mangekyō Sharingan,
Rinnegan, and related dōjutsu.

**Naruto**, all character names, and related fictional concepts are the
intellectual property of their respective rights holders (Masashi Kishimoto,
Shueisha, Viz Media, etc.). This project is created purely for educational,
artistic, and experimental purposes as an homage to these concepts.

This software itself is provided under the MIT License above.
